if mibBuilder.loadTexts: tmnxChassisRedForcedSingleSfm.setDescription("The value of tmnxChassisRedForcedSingleSfm specifies whether or not\n         the IGP single-SFM-overload state is forced to 'overload' in the\n         router instances where single-SFM-overload state (referred to as\n         TIMETRA-VRTR-MIB::vRtrSingleSfmOverloadAdminState) is equal to\n         'inService'.")
